A container of a key value name pair.
.sp
Key \-> (string) [required]
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Name of the object key.
.sp
Constraints:
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
min: \fB1\fP
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Value \-> (string) [required]
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Value of the tag.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
